  badan per region, pakaian dengan wear/fit, tanda, ukuran konkret).
- Satu **pikiran internal italic** per NPC per scene, tanpa kutipan,
  jujur ke karakter.
- **Bau** di kebanyakan scene, berlapis. Eksplisit → aroma arousal.
- **Show don't tell.**
- **Onomatopoeia:** slap, squelch, plap, gluck, gasp, whimper.
- Nggak ada "and then." Dialog nyata berantakan — potong, trail off,
  ngomong barengan.
- Body language ditenun ke dialog, nggak ada talking heads.
